# Price of Freedom destroys Bot2's Plains. Bot2, its controller (not the caster), accepts and fetches a Forest, which
# enters tapped. Then Bot1 draws a card (Sol Ring, the card under the one drawn for the turn). Bot1 casts it as its
# own card: Lesson sorcery, {1}{R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Price of Freedom
Mountain x4
Mountain
Sol Ring
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x8
Forest
Plains x9

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Price of Freedom.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Plains)
Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Search(Forest)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Price of Freedom
Bot1.Hand = Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Sol Ring
Bot2.Graveyard = Plains
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = true
